('contact_detail', '29. Contact Information (Detailed)', E'## 29. Contact Information (Detailed)\n\n### College Address\nLBS College of Engineering\nPovval, Muliyar P.O.\nKasaragod, Kerala - 671542\nIndia\n\n### Phone Numbers\n- **Office:** +91-4994-256300, +91-4994-256301\n- **Principal:** 04994-250290\n- **Director (LBS Centre):** 0471-2324396\n\n### Email Addresses\n- **Principal:** principal@lbscek.ac.in\n- **Office:** office@lbscek.ac.in\n- **Admission:** admission@lbscek.ac.in\n- **Administrative Officer:** administrativeofficer@lbscek.ac.in\n- **CGPU (Placements):** cgpu@lbscek.ac.in\n- **Hostel Warden:** warden@lbscek.ac.in\n- **Library:** library@lbscek.ac.in\n- **CSE Department:** csed@lbscek.ac.in\n- **ME Department:** med@lbscek.ac.in\n- **EEE Department:** eed@lbscek.ac.in\n- **CE Department:** ced@lbscek.ac.in\n- **Director:** director.lbs@kerala.gov.in\n\n### Website\n- **Official:** https://lbscek.ac.in/\n- **LBS Centre:** http://www.lbscentre.kerala.gov.in/', 29)

